{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42201","headline":"陈觉放还至泰州以诗见寄作此答之 · 徐铉","name":"陈觉放还至泰州以诗见寄作此答之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱云曾爲汉家忧，不怕交亲作世仇。\n壮气未平空咄咄，狂言无騐信悠悠。\n今朝我作伤弓鸟，却羡君爲不系舟。\n劳寄新诗平宿憾，此生心气贯清秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}